	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Consolatorias tuas adeoque gratulatorias,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vermutlich in Zusammenhang mit <persName ref="p8354">Frölichs</persName> überwundenem, lebensbedrohlichen Geschwür; s. <ref target="file13048">Nr. 2999</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17266-2" type="qv"/>; <ref target="file13054">Nr. 3005</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17272-15" type="qv"/>; und unten Z. <ptr target="qvzl17298-1" type="qv"/>.<ptr target="zfnfn17298-3" type="zfn"/></note> frater observandissime, accepi.<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Mit einem nicht mehr erhaltenen Brief <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName>.</note></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Accepi etiam Apologiam tuam contra offensiones ex bello infeliciter <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>gesto ortas,<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Schrift Contra scandala ex bello infeliciter gesto oborta Apologia; s. dazu <ref target="file13072">Nr. 3023</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17291-2" type="qv"/>.<ptr target="zfnfn17298-2" type="zfn"/></note> quę adeo me delectarunt, ut partem egritudinis meę <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>inde sublatam esse crędam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Dominus vicissim te soletur et conservet <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in omnibus afflictionibus, quas scio te propter rempublicam christianam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>non parvas sustinere, conservet te, inquam, ad retinendam et tuendam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>veritatem contra Christi crudelissimos hostes, quorum cristę nunc <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fere in medium aerem eriguntur!<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Vgl. <bibl source="b56">Adagia</bibl> 1, 8, 69 (<bibl>ASD</bibl> II/2 294, <ref target="file10807">Nr. 769</ref>); <bibl source="b473">Otto</bibl> 98, Nr. 467.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Ego me patri rerum<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><cit type="bible"><ref>1Kor 8, 6</ref></cit>.</note> unico atque <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>mea omnia unice commendavi,<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Ps 22 (Vulg. 21), 8f</ref></cit>.</note> cui quoque vivam et moriar,<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 14, 8</ref></cit>.</note> nec <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>multum formidavi in periculosissima mea infirmitate humanę <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>carnis resolutionem<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>2Kor 1, 17.</ref></cit> - <persName ref="p8354">Frölich</persName> war der Gefahr einer Ahndung durch die Kaiserlichen besonders ausgesetzt; s. <ref target="file13026">Nr. 2977</ref>,<ptr target="qvzl17243-4" type="qv"/>.<ptr target="zfnfn17298-1" type="zfn"/></note>, sed oravi dominum, ut, si contingeret me hinc migrare, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ut lęto animo fieret mihi tanquam illi, qui ex ergastulo ad hortulum <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>amenissimum et ex transitoriis molestiis ad ęterna dei omnipotentis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>regna iturus sit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Nescis et vix crędis sane, quantis calamitatibus <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>et miseriis optimus quisque piorum apud multos hincinde<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">überall (hier wie dort); s. <bibl source="b616">Stotz</bibl> IV 436, Nr. 4.2.</note> prematur!</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Fatuus propterea censendus iure est, qui vanissimo huic <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>mundo multo studio diu immorari cupit.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Ne cessaveris igitur e<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>t dominum pro me orare, ut vias meas ad gloriam suam dirigere clęmenter <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dignetur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego nondum revalui penitus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Nam ex apostemate<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Geschwür. - Siehe dazu oben <ptr target="qvfn17298-3" type="qv"/>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tantum vulnus accepi, ut vix adhuc in mense sanari poterit.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Accesserunt pręterea dispositiones febriles, item angustie circa pectus, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ita ut <pb type="edition" next="516"/> adhuc graviter affligar.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed bene est: Hoc pacto video me esse <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>filium benignissimi patris, qui me paterne corripit.<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Spr 3, 12</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>Hebr 12, 6</ref></cit>.</note></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Plura nunc <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>nequeo.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName> verließ <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> am 3. oder 4. Oktober; s. <ref target="file13066">Nr. 3017</ref>, <ptr target="qvfn17285-4" type="qv"/>.</note>, perpetuus frater noster, erit viva epistola.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Dominos <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>consules<note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p1419">Johannes Haab</persName> und <persName ref="p1888">Hans Rudolf Lavater</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8339">archigrammateum</persName><note xml:id="fn14" type="footnote" n="14">Stadtschreiber <persName ref="p8339">Hans Escher vom Luchs</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherum</persName>, cor meum, <persName ref="p8127">Pellicanum</persName>, <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerum</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/><persName ref="p1214">Frisium</persName><note xml:id="fn15" type="footnote" n="15"><persName ref="p1214">Johannes Fries</persName>.</note> atque singulos christiadas<note xml:id="fn16" type="footnote" n="16">= christianos.</note> apud vos salvos esse cupio.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Ego legam Apologiam tuam diligenter, pro qua atque omni beneficentia <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>tua, si possum, responsurus sum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale cum honestissima domo <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>tua.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">3. octobris 1547.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8354">Georgius Laetus</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Incomparabili viro atque amico, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>domino <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, apud <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> antistiti vigilantissimo.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zurch</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>